         <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:00000">
             <div type="textpart" n="1">
             <head xml:lang="eng">To the right of the zodiac diagram</head>
         	    <p><lb n="1"/>6 roca puṣya candra<lb n="2" break="no"/>-vāra Uttara-phalguni<lb n="3" break="no"/>-nakṣatra madhyā<lb n="4" break="no"/>hna yoga vraḥ liṅga</p>
   </div>
             <div type="textpart" n="2">
             <head xml:lang="eng">Inside the zodiac diagram</head>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="0"/><label xml:lang="eng">Aries</label><subst><del rend="corrected">cau</del><add place="below">bhau</add></subst> sau</ab>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="2"/><label xml:lang="eng">Gemini</label>la ji</ab>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="7"/><label xml:lang="eng">Scorpio</label>rā</ab>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="8"/><label xml:lang="eng">Sagittarius</label>ca</ab>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="10"/><label xml:lang="eng">Aquarius</label>k<unclear>e</unclear></ab>
                 <ab><milestone unit="zone" n="11"/><label xml:lang="eng">Pisces</label>Ā vu śu</ab>
             </div>
             <div type="textpart" n="3">
                 <ab><lb n="1"/>pūrva</ab>
             </div>
          </div>
         <div type="apparatus">    
         </div>
         <div type="translation" resp="part:chch">
 	<!--translation encoded as per EGD §9.2 -->
         </div>
             <div type="translation" xml:lang="fra" resp="part:chch">
<p n="1-4">Au sixième jour de la quinzaine sombre, durant le mois de Puṣya, un lundi, au <foreign>nakṣatra</foreign> de <foreign>uttaraphalguṇī</foreign>, à midi <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>madhyāhna</foreign></supplied> [c’est alors qu’eût lieu] le <foreign>yoga</foreign> [auprès du] Saint Liṅga.</p>
         </div>
         <div type="commentary">
             <p>See <ref target="DHARMA_INSCIK00260_1.xml">K. 260-1</ref> for another example of zodiac diagram during the Angkorian period.</p>
         </div>
        <div type="bibliography">
           <p>First edited in French and English by Chloé Chollet in her PhD thesis, from a photogrammetric model created by Adeline Levivier in May 2022. Based on previous reading by Gerdi Gerschheimer.</p>
